  "qualifications": [
    "JSON parsing stays delegated to the existing serde RawValue validation and lossless extractor. UTF8 input uses the original decoder unchanged.",
    "Native syntax diagnostics, including explicit invalid-UTF16-placement errors, retain their actual backend wording/category. They are qualified separately; accepted values and refusal decisions have no tolerance.",
    "The UTF16 adapter tracks quote/escape context only to transcode valid literal unpaired units. It does not parse JSON structure, values or schemas.",
    "Invalid placement is reported with its original code-unit value/position in the existing serde error carrier. No lossy replacement is performed.",
    "Recorder/replay composition is not included in this checkpoint; its uncommitted files are independent and unstaged."
  ]
